The spec file has a critical typo in the build section where `%pyton_wheel` is used instead of `%pyproject_wheel`, which will cause the build to fail. Additionally, the missing `/usr/bin/oterm` executable in the `%files` section is causing the 'Installed (but unpackaged) file(s)' error. The `BuildRequires: %{python_module pip}` line should be included to support the wheel build process.